@startuml NovaMarket_Order_Saga_Delivery_Failure
title Sequence Diagram: Delivery Request Failure (Full Compensation Flow)

actor Buyer as buyer
participant "Mobile App" as app
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
participant "Order Service" as order
participant "Inventory Service" as inventory
participant "Payment Service" as payment
participant "Delivery Service" as delivery
participant "Notification Service" as notification
participant "Message Broker" as broker
participant "Payment Gateway" as pgateway
participant "Logistics Provider" as logistics

== Step 1-3: Order Created, Inventory Reserved, Payment Processed ==
buyer -> app: Оформить заказ
app -> gateway: POST /orders
gateway -> order: CreateOrderCommand
order -> broker: Publish OrderCreated
order --> gateway: OrderCreated (201)

broker -> inventory: Consume OrderCreated
inventory -> inventory: Reserve items
inventory -> broker: Publish InventoryReserved

broker -> payment: Consume InventoryReserved
payment -> pgateway: ProcessPayment()
pgateway --> payment: PaymentSuccess
payment -> broker: Publish PaymentProcessed

== Step 4: Delivery Request Fails ==
broker -> delivery: Consume PaymentProcessed
delivery -> logistics: CreateDeliveryRequest()
logistics --> delivery: DeliveryRejected\n(Address unavailable)
delivery -> broker: Publish DeliveryRequestFailed

== Step 5: Compensation - Refund Payment ==
broker -> payment: Consume DeliveryRequestFailed
payment -> pgateway: RefundPayment()
pgateway --> payment: RefundSuccess
payment -> broker: Publish PaymentRefunded

== Step 6: Compensation - Release Inventory ==
broker -> inventory: Consume PaymentRefunded
inventory -> inventory: Release reservation
inventory -> broker: Publish InventoryReleased

== Step 7: Cancel Order ==
broker -> order: Consume DeliveryRequestFailed
order -> order: Update status to CANCELLED
order -> broker: Publish OrderCancelled

== Step 8: Notify Buyer ==
broker -> notification: Consume DeliveryRequestFailed
notification -> buyer: Push: Доставка невозможна
broker -> notification: Consume PaymentRefunded
notification -> buyer: Push: Средства возвращены
broker -> notification: Consume OrderCancelled
notification -> buyer: Push: Заказ отменён
notification -> broker: Publish NotificationSent

note over buyer, logistics: Order cancelled - delivery unavailable\nFull refund processed

@enduml